          "type": "direction",
          "content": "$2\\sqrt{3} \\times \\sqrt{3} = 2 \\times 3$ ."
        }
      ],
      "feedback": {
        "correct": "$B = \\dfrac{5\\sqrt{3}}{2 \\times 3} = \\dfrac{5\\sqrt{3}}{6}$",
        "incorrect": "اضرب البسط أيضًا في $\\sqrt{3}$ ، و احسب المقام $2\\sqrt{3} \\times \\sqrt{3}$ ."
      },
      "solution": {
        "lines": [
          "$B = \\dfrac{5 \\times \\sqrt{3}}{2\\sqrt{3} \\times \\sqrt{3}}$",
          "$= \\dfrac{5\\sqrt{3}}{2 \\times 3}$"
        ],
        "result": "B = \\dfrac{5\\sqrt{3}}{6}"
      },
