        {
          "id": "h2",
          "type": "direction",
          "content": "لاحظ أن $C$ من الشكل $(x + y)(x - y)$ ."
        },
        {
          "id": "h3",
          "type": "strategy",
          "content": "استعمل $(5\\sqrt{3})^2 = 25 \\times 3$ ."
        }
      ],
      "feedback": {
        "correct": "$6B = 5\\sqrt{3} = A$ ، إذن $C = (5\\sqrt{3})^2 - 2^2 = 75 - 4 = 71$ .",
        "incorrect": "اكتب $6B$ على الشكل $k\\sqrt{3}$ ثم استعمل $(x + y)(x - y) = x^2 - y^2$ و ربّع المعامل أيضًا."
      },
      "solution": {
        "lines": [
          "$6B = 6 \\times \\dfrac{5\\sqrt{3}}{6} = 5\\sqrt{3}$",
          "$C = (5\\sqrt{3} + 2)(5\\sqrt{3} - 2)$",
          "$= (5\\sqrt{3})^2 - 2^2 = 75 - 4$"
        ],
        "result": "C = 71"
